{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zongshi-e-o084","title":"松黄龙三年卒","accounts":[{"id":"zongshi-a-3b77c3a649397f5def5f","label":"正文","text":"松黄龙三年卒","evidence":["zongshi-q-0e6653dcb59d9ace7a40"]}],"participants":[{"person":"luxun-p0027","role":"卒者","evidence":["zongshi-q-0e6653dcb59d9ace7a40"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["zongshi-q-0e6653dcb59d9ace7a40"]},"ordering_evidence":"zongshi-q-0e6653dcb59d9ace7a40","source_order":[51,148,19],"order":9191},{"id":"zongshi-e-o133","title":"松镇巴丘，数咨陆逊以得失；尝有小过，逊面责松，松意色不平；逊进而尽言，松笑而自责","accounts":[{"id":"zongshi-a-00e959e070e141cf4de5","label":"裴注·吴录","text":"松镇巴丘，数咨陆逊以得失；尝有小过，逊面责松，松意色不平；逊进而尽言，松笑而自责","evidence":["zongshi-q-ed6a442406ec48553b3d"]}],"participants":[{"person":"luxun-p0027","role":"镇巴丘咨逊者","evidence":["zongshi-q-ed6a442406ec48553b3d"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0115","role":"面责尽言者","evidence":["zongshi-q-ed6a442406ec48553b3d"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["zongshi-q-ed6a442406ec48553b3d"]},"ordering_evidence":"zongshi-q-ed6a442406ec48553b3d","source_order":[51,159,22],"order":9194},{"id":"luxun-e-o033a","title":"陆议髡孙松职吏","accounts":[{"id":"luxun-e-o033a-account","label":"《陆逊传第十三》正文","text":"陆议髡孙松职吏","evidence":["luxun-e-o033a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0115","role":"惩吏","evidence":["luxun-e-o033a-q"]},{"person":"luxun-p0027","role":"治兵不整","evidence":["luxun-e-o033a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"孙松戏兵不整时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["luxun-e-o033a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"luxun-e-o033a-q","source_order":[58,152,"O033a"],"order":10335}],"persons":[{"id":"luxun-p0027","name":"孙松","evidence":["luxun-q-o033","luxun-q-b-93ec0435ba8b7bfdccb6","zongshi-q-0e6653dcb59d9ace7a40","zongshi-q-d171f3dae8208121cf2b","zongshi-q-ed6a442406ec48553b3d","zongshi-q2-284311666ebc5a7aaab3"],"facts":[{"id":"zongshi-f2-b343565334ed220ce1a1","text":"孙翊之子，为射声校尉，封都乡侯，黄龙三年卒；诸葛亮致瑾书悼之，其说转自养子乔所述。","evidence":["zongshi-q2-284311666ebc5a7aaab3"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"luxun-m-o033-luxun-p0027","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["luxun-q-o033","luxun-q-b-93ec0435ba8b7bfdccb6"]},{"id":"zongshi-m2-8e430c112fbb8b500732","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zongshi-q-d171f3dae8208121cf2b"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"luxun-e-o033a-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-aea88525e68b8d6103dc","layer":"original","quote":"射声校尉松于公子中最亲〖6〗，戏兵不整〖7〗；逊对之髡其职吏〖8〗。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34},{"id":"luxun-q-b-93ec0435ba8b7bfdccb6","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-93ec0435ba8b7bfdccb6","layer":"modern","quote":"〖6〗松：即孙松（？—公元 231）。是孙权的侄儿。传附本书卷五十一《孙翊传》。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":164,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-fbfa1084caf5a246aaf4","start":0,"end":40},{"id":"luxun-q-o033","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-aea88525e68b8d6103dc","layer":"original","quote":"射声校尉松于公子中最亲〖6〗，戏兵不整〖7〗；逊对之髡其职吏〖8〗。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34},{"id":"zongshi-q-0e6653dcb59d9ace7a40","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-8877039d9de3706167d8","layer":"original","quote":"黄龙三年卒","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":147,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":19,"end":24},{"id":"zongshi-q-d171f3dae8208121cf2b","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-8877039d9de3706167d8","layer":"original","quote":"蜀丞相诸葛亮与兄瑾书曰：“既受东朝厚遇〖3〗，依依于子弟〖4〗。又子乔良器〖5〗，为之恻怆；见其所与亮器物，感用流涕","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":147,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":25,"end":83},{"id":"zongshi-q-ed6a442406ec48553b3d","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-87725d1754495f952286","layer":"pei","quote":"镇巴丘，数咨陆逊以得失。尝有小过，逊面责松，松意色不平。逊观其少释，谓曰：‘君过听不以某鄙，数见访及；是以承来意，进尽言。便变色，何也？’松笑曰：‘属亦自忿行事有此，岂有望邪","attribution":"裴注·吴录","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":158,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-79d12a577703f4656017","start":22,"end":109},{"id":"zongshi-q2-284311666ebc5a7aaab3","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-8877039d9de3706167d8","layer":"original","quote":"子松，为射声校尉〖2〗，都乡侯。﹝三﹞黄龙三年卒。蜀丞相诸葛亮与兄瑾书曰：“既受东朝厚遇〖3〗，依依于子弟〖4〗。又子乔良器〖5〗，为之恻怆；见其所与亮器物，感用流涕！”其悼松如此，由亮养子乔咨述故云〖6〗。","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":147,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":104}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
